      "english": "What time do you go home?",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "00508_kaeru_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{来年|らいねん}→来年：00745_rainen⟧、⟦{国|くに}→国：02204_kuni⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{帰|かえ}ります。",
      "english": "I will return to my country next year.",
