  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive). No pair verb. Pattern: X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{帰|かえ}る (return to X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates resulting state. {帰|かえ}っている = 'has returned (and is there now).'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・⟦{家|いえ}→家：00612_ie⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{帰|かえ}る (go home)\n・⟦{国|くに}→国：02204_kuni⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{帰|かえ}る (return to one's country)\n・お{帰|かえ}りなさい (welcome home - greeting)\n・{帰|かえ}り (return trip - noun)\n\nGodan verb despite ending in る. Different from ⟦{戻|もど}る→戻る：01117_modoru⟧ (return to previous state) and ⟦{変|か}える→変える：01089_kaeru⟧ (to change - ichidan).",
